6\nwww.v6imoveis.com.br\nAs informações estão sujeitas a alterações. Consulte o corretor responsável.","fotos":["https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/d030bf1c-cb5f-40bc-85f7-250dca9782f2/images/828e9ec7-4bde-4864-9a63-139fb9d1ff341749145580ia5R.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/d030bf1c-cb5f-40bc-85f7-250dca9782f2/images/8d22f2f0-aef8-4dca-80c5-a973ed825a8d1749145619qJJp.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/d030bf1c-cb5f-40bc-85f7-250dca9782f2/images/389a1c9c-16b8-4962-8c6f-c107eedf6ef51749145468yEQi.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/d030bf1c-cb5f-40bc-85f7-250dca9782f2/images/91868169-471c-41e3-8e2b-99359d4005dd1749145620G852.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/d030bf1c-cb5f-40bc-85f7-250dca9782f2/images/20b14423-2c88-4cfc-b792-92034d03fe7d1749145420DVJt.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/d030bf1c-cb5f-40bc-85f7-250dca9782f2/images/d6449f2a-5952-4211-9bce-b02ea58236941749145681r8HN.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/d030bf1c-cb5f-40bc-85f7-250dca9782f2/images/a1e90eab-d371-4cbf-acaf-064c910c87aa1749145622eSbl.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/d030bf1c-cb5f-40bc-85f7-250dca9782f2/images/4c399cf0-0895-4933-aa1e-2162b979f0af1749145527SlLj.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/d030bf1c-cb5f-40bc-85f7-250dca9782f2/images/e7db1706-ec4b-4895-a456-6f3edfbe0b671749145731Galr.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com.br/media/bd45af7b-ad51-4cfc-92e9-98d81a11fe3f/properties/d030bf1c-cb5f-40bc-85f7-250dca9782f2/images/73399b9c-3867-4e90-be48-6dde89ef6ebf1749145578x06A.jpg","https://imagens.tecimob.com